        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Rhys-Davies, Timothy Dalton\n- Products: The Living Daylights, The Untouchables, Shōgun, Sliders, Robin of Sherwood, I, Claudius, James Bond film series\n- Roles: Agent Michael Malone, Pilot Vasco Rodrigues, Professor Maximillian Arturo, King Richard I, General Leonid Pushkin, Macro, James Bond\n\nFacts:\n- John Rhys-Davies played Macro in I, Claudius.\n- John Rhys-Davies played Pilot Vasco Rodrigues in the mini-series Shōgun.\n- John Rhys-Davies played King Richard I in Robin of Sherwood.\n- The Living Daylights was released in 1987 as the fifteenth film in the James Bond film series.\n- The Living Daylights was the first James Bond film to star Timothy Dalton as the fictional MI6 agent James Bond.\n- John Rhys-Davies played General Leonid Pushkin in the James Bond film The Living Daylights.\n- John Rhys-Davies played Agent Michael Malone in the 1993 remake of the 1950s television series The Untouchables.\n- John Rhys-Davies played Professor Maximillian Arturo in Sliders.",
